## Launch Soon Page

**URL**: `https://cosmoq.framer.website/launchin-soon...`

### Content
- **H1**: "Something Exciting is Coming Soon!"
- **Description**: "Registered and Keep yourself inform to get first access"

### Email Capture
- Input field for email
- **CTA Button**: "Get Early Access"
- **Social Proof**: "2,300+ People already joined"

### Layout CSS

```css
.launch-soon {
  min-height: 100vh;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  text-align: center;
}

.email-capture {
  display: flex;
  gap: 12px;
  margin-top: 32px;
}

.email-input {
  background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
  border: 1px solid rgba(125, 164, 255, 0.16);
  border-radius: 8px;
  padding: 16px 24px;
  min-width: 300px;
  color: #fff;
}

.early-access-btn {
  background: linear-gradient(90deg, #0175ff, #0066dd);
  border-radius: 8px;
  padding: 16px 32px;
  color: #fff;
  font-weight: 600;
}

.social-proof {
  margin-top: 16px;
  color: #9ba9c4;
  font-size: 14px;
}
```

