## Legal Page Typography

```css
.legal-content {
  max-width: 800px;
  margin: 0 auto;
  padding: 80px 40px;
}

.legal-content h2 {
  font-size: 24px;
  font-weight: 500;
  margin-top: 48px;
  color: #fff;
}

.legal-content p {
  font-size: 16px;
  line-height: 1.7;
  color: #ccc;
  margin-top: 16px;
}

.legal-content ul {
  margin-top: 16px;
  padding-left: 24px;
}

.legal-content li {
  margin: 8px 0;
  color: #ccc;
}
```
